  "_comment": "Soft flasks (the collapsible running/fastpacking flask), 2026-08-06. Requested from the Black Diamond Distance Flask 500 ml, then extended to the same item from other brands ALREADY in the catalog — the catalog previously carried soft flasks from CNOC only. Every weight is the maker's published spec for the EMPTY flask; where the maker's own site blocks fetching (Salomon, Osprey) the spec is taken from a retailer republishing it verbatim. Two requested-adjacent items were dropped rather than estimated: CamelBak's Quick Stow Flask (CamelBak publishes no weight, and retailers disagree — 37 g vs 55 g 'with mouthpiece'), and Nathan's Soft Flask with ExoSpine (Nathan publishes a weight only for the ExoDraw handheld, and that figure is the flask PLUS its handheld carrier, not the flask). Pa'lante's item is named 'water bottle' by Pa'lante, but it is a 500 ml soft collapsible bottle with a bite valve — the same object as the rest of this batch — so it takes the 'soft flask' gear type rather than 'water bottle'.",
